<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-FORECAST-Australian Q4 GDP seen up 0.6 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-FORECAST-Australian Q4 GDP seen up 0.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are results of a Reuter survey of economists on Australian GDP forecasts for the December quarter (s/adj). Comparison with previous quarter unless stated.</p>
<p>GDP figures are due out at 0030 GMT on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The figures have been revised following stocks data on Monday, with the median forecast for GDP-Average rising to 0.6 percent, from a median of 0.5 percent, for the quarter and to 3.6 percent, from 3.5 percent, in annual terms in a survey held on Friday.  </p>
